  'bio.sinanovic.text': "A photographer from Sanski Most, he is the author of the photo books Bosna i Hercegovina očima ljubavi and Sanski Most, grad u ogledalu od rijeka. In Homo faber (2025), he photographs people who live and work on the margins of society.",
  'bio.cikan.role': "Podgrmeč footballer",
  'bio.cikan.text': "Born in 1968, Hasan Hadžić, known as Ćikan, played for Podgrmeč as the club climbed from the second cantonal league after the war. He continued to work with the club after his playing career. During the war he served in the Fifth Corps of the Army of the Republic of Bosnia and Herzegovina. He died in Sanski Most on 28 June 2016. The town’s New Year indoor football tournament named its top scorer award after him.",
